abstract: >-
  SolarChain is a controlled embodied-IoT research prototype that connects
  physics-bounded photovoltaic verification, persistent agent and planner
  coordination, configurable reward and liquidity allocation, and replayable
  hash-linked auditing with blockchain-backed energy settlement.
keywords:
  - embodied Internet of Things
  - physics-grounded verification
  - multi-agent coordination
  - urban solar energy
  - decentralized energy markets
  - false-data injection
